        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://milltownhs.ning.com/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1917, a local newspaper dubbed Milltown “the greatest little town in all the land,” a nickname still celebrated by residents today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://milltownhistoricalsociety.com/",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "other"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Milltown’s Main Street hosts a self‑guided walking tour that guides visitors through historic buildings and the town’s original 19th‑century architecture.",
